    <div data-dc-tpl="550" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: &quot;Barlow Condensed&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(214, 188, 133);"><span data-dc-tpl="551" style="width: 26px; height: 1px; background: rgba(185, 156, 102, 0.6);"></span>The kitchen is the point</div>
