          <span data-dc-tpl="559" style="position: relative; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(234, 226, 214, 0.85); margin-top: 8px;"><span class="sc-interp">Rehearsal dinners, showers, engagement parties, receptions.</span></span>
